# O1 + SPACE lighting: a small planetary system lit only by a point light
# at the star. The star is a world-size solid disc under an additive soft
# glow; planets are spheres lit on the side facing it; orbits are line
# loops; a belt is 400 small points; labels are text with a drop shadow.
